<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/arunDatI/dict/kna/2> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "अरुन्धती\t/arundhatī/\t/arundhatI/\t/арундхати/\tarundhatī f. извѣстная звѣзда (Alkor).\tс. 200"@ru ;
